[h1]Suggestions[/h1]
Ideas for new starting scenarios, changes to existing routes, and translation corrections go here. One suggestion per reply so each can be discussed and tracked on its own. Bugs go in the Bug Reports thread, questions in the Questions thread.

[h2]What helps[/h2]
[list]
    [*]The problem you are trying to solve, not only the feature you have in mind. A setting in MCM sometimes already covers it.
    [*]Which route it applies to (Cultured Start narrative, Start Editor, or a specific one of the eight starting scenarios).
    [*]For translation fixes: the game language, the exact current text, and the text you propose.
[/list]

[h2]Ground rules[/h2]
[list]
    [*]Every bound the mod uses (gold, tiers, troop counts, renown) is read live from the running game. A suggestion that needs a hardcoded number instead is out of scope.
    [*]The Start Editor works with vanilla and modded items already registered in the game; it does not add new items of its own.
    [*]This release supports Bannerlord v1.4.8 only.
[/list]

[h2]What happens next[/h2]
Accepted suggestions ship in a MINOR or PATCH update and are listed in the Change Notes tab. A reply in this thread will say which version carries it. Declined ones get a reply with the reason.
